4341|# ---- claude adapter (wave 29: Claude Code headless, `claude -p`; ROADMAP R10 with R22 - the design
4342|# of the task claude-engine-2026-09-30 as amended by its decisions D1-D12)
4343|
4344|# (D4 / F02-3) THE model table of the claude engine: the aliases the CLI resolves itself (its help:
4345|# "an alias for the latest model") and the published model ids (2026-09-25). A roster entry of the
4346|# engine names one of them - optionally with the 1M-context suffix [1m], stripped before every
4347|# comparison - and the telemetry's closed model list of the vendor class anthropic IS this table.
4348|# Anything else is refused by the roster validator and reads `other` in telemetry; the ledger keeps
4349|# the real name. (wave 29b, E2) The table does NOT apply to auth endpoint (a third-party
4350|# Anthropic-compatible endpoint): its model is the id as the provider publishes it, matching
4351|# $script:ClaudeEndpointModelRe (an optional [1m] suffix), sent straight as --model <id>.
4352|$script:ClaudeModelAliases = @('opus', 'sonnet', 'haiku', 'fable')
