7567|# failure happened and when the endpoint is expected back - a known reset, or Hit + 60 min, or
7568|# (wave 24c) Hit + 10 min for a burst); Credential (the credential result, $null before the
7569|# check); Burst (wave 24c: the quota-unknown-reset is a burst - a 429 that names no usage window or
7570|# quota: "burst limit (429) hit <iso>, reset unknown; retry after <iso + 10 min>") }. In this order:
